sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Khách hàng
    participant C as UserBookingController
    participant S as BookingService
    participant F as FieldRepository
    participant B as BookingRepository
    participant P as PricingService
    participant V as VoucherService
    participant M as MembershipService
    participant I as InventoryService
    participant N as NotificationService

    Customer->>C: POST /api/user/bookings
    C->>S: createBooking(request, userId)
    S->>F: find field
    S->>B: lock/check overlapping slots
    alt Trùng lịch hoặc bảo trì
        S-->>C: lỗi không thể đặt sân
    else Khung giờ hợp lệ
        S->>P: calculatePrice(fieldId, start, end)
        P-->>S: originalPrice
        opt Có voucher
            S->>V: validate/apply voucher
            V-->>S: voucherDiscount
        end
        S->>M: applyMembershipDiscount(user, price)
        M-->>S: membershipDiscount
        opt Có dịch vụ thêm quản lý tồn
            S->>I: reserve inventory
            I-->>S: reservation
        end
        S->>B: save booking + payment + extras
        S->>N: notifyAdminsBookingCreated()
        S-->>C: BookingResponse
        C-->>Customer: booking PENDING
    end

